{"id":"131ee254ab59ba2b","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ml-excess-diverges.md","title":"随机前缀的复杂度超额趋无穷","display":"thm-ml-excess-diverges — 随机前缀的复杂度超额趋无穷","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ml-excess-diverges","aliases":["43-thm-ml-excess-diverges"],"display":"thm-ml-excess-diverges — 随机前缀的复杂度超额趋无穷","depends_on":["[[43-thm-ample-excess]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.4 Corollary 9.4.2后讨论，印刷183，PDF203","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ml-excess-diverges"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ml-excess-diverges</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ml-excess-diverges — 随机前缀的复杂度超额趋无穷"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d42acaaa07bd3c4a\" href=\"?note=d42acaaa07bd3c4a\" title=\"43-thm-ample-excess\">43-thm-ample-excess</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.4 Corollary 9.4.2后讨论，印刷183，PDF203"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；随机性及固定最优K见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\bigl(K(X\\upharpoonright n)-n\\bigr)=+\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\bigl(K(X\\upharpoonright n)-n\\bigr)=+\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地推导：Ample Excess级数收敛意味着其非负项趋零，取以2为底对数即得。不能把“存在固定下界”误读成超额可保持常数。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.4 Corollary 9.4.2后讨论，印刷183，PDF203。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-thm-ample-excess","status":"resolved","id":"d42acaaa07bd3c4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-ample-excess]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；随机性及固定最优K见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；随机性及固定最优K见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\bigl(K(X\\upharpoonright n)-n\\bigr)=+\\infty.","display":true}],"bytes":1260,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-excess-diverges]] — 随机前缀的复杂度超额趋无穷"}],"outgoing":["d42acaaa07bd3c4a","0586e0fd0301d605","6cd902d852c2c848"]}